{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "86a1be66bc781718f840128627c73061b8b1e22cba26d4a7259c217911bdc38a", "ja": "（まつり、朋花、美也のユニットによる\n野外ライブは見事、大成功で幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（由茉莉、朋花和美也组成的组合，在户外举办的演唱会圆满成功地落下了帷幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "a2319400c5f3377496032597530a5839ded3c4e43fe4215f0e57b2325bfd18ce", "ja": "とってもわんだほー！なステージだったのです！\n{$P$}さん、どうでしたか？", "zh": "真是棒极了的舞台呀！\n{$P$}先生，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "71264ef3a4637dc59fede9644697d9016139aea5b8cbbf4fd9af1894dfc3be95", "ja": "ああ。すごくいいステージだったと思う。\n合宿から今日まで、本当にお疲れさま。", "zh": "啊，我觉得这是场非常棒的演出。\n从集训到今天，真的辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bea2d97d83daaae42c26c5ba86e8f381360a860ae22180f9168d12870d13712a", "ja": "最年長のまつりには、色々と苦労をかけたかも\nしれないけど、おかげで大成功だよ。ありがとう。", "zh": "作为年龄最大的まつり，可能让你费了不少心，但多亏了你，这次大获成功。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "d17ad18f690f44f6bbffa934fec13f396bb41812d13d139c23b07717c7ec2449", "ja": "ほ？　姫は、苦労なんてしていないのですよ。\n合宿も、とっても楽しかったのです！", "zh": "诶？公主才没有觉得辛苦呢。  \n集训也特别开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "18b133db78ec2b51d8ffa3fbbf4ee41640c76ccd27d9730b31eadbcad5598c39", "ja": "二人とも、たくさん頑張ってくれたので、\nお礼は姫ではなく、みんなに言って欲しいのです。", "zh": "因为你们两位都付出了很多努力，所以请不要向本公主道谢，而是向大家道谢哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9cc739fdde1cf9d4ad0a6fb87d99fb1830550ef5cf7051c764fe730c4d4234f2", "ja": "それはもちろん。ただ合宿の夜も、いろいろと\n話を聞いてくれたって、二人が言ってたんだ。", "zh": "那当然。不过她们俩还说，合宿的晚上，你也听她们说了很多话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1007_p", "source_sha256": "75ed1e18b8950756b6288d948e24e044bad9d45acfe1cb8809712ba65603f474", "ja": "それに「がんばってくれた」っていうのは、\n先頭に立った人の言葉な気もするし。", "zh": "而且，“你也努力了”这句话，感觉也是站在最前面带头的人才会说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "ec6482f377e7ffedcdbce63fe8f996a661c1fef6436d7f0d9945825865977fe5", "ja": "それは……きっと、本当に気のせいなのです。\n仕方のない{$P$}さんなのです。", "zh": "那……一定真的只是错觉。是没办法的{$P$}先生哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "164f8fdc015d23f68a737fd53a2e743f6e2a8b8dfbce7c7cf6ba9d732de551f9", "ja": "姫は、ファンのみんなの楽しそうな顔をたくさん\n見られたので、それだけで大満足なのです♪", "zh": "公主看到了好多粉丝们开心的笑脸，\n只要这样就已经非常满足了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e061b27d2657f82cad264692b4763db010131c0102c0562de7b112aa2b61ee68", "ja": "はは、そうかもな。とにかく、まだ合宿の疲れもライブ\nの疲れもあるだろうから、ゆっくり休むんだぞ？", "zh": "哈哈，或许吧。总之，你们应该还没从集训和演出的疲劳中恢复过来，先好好休息吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "e16f5ec0a4cf4b263a5e4e0d392ecd75ecd53307747462d6eff9eaf7f438c000", "ja": "むぅ……{$P$}さん？\nさっきから、姫のことを心配しすぎなのです！", "zh": "唔……{$P$}先生？从刚才开始，你也太担心姬了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "e7eae4509e4e458ece26f37348cc91013f07dcafb3003432419bdd16dd97a694", "ja": "姫は、無理なんてしないのです。\n疲れだって、全然残ってないのですよ？", "zh": "公主可不会勉强自己哦。\n而且也完全没有留下一点疲劳呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1013_p", "source_sha256": "45b8d1d492223dd5c10635bed77d14dc7c543c3e89c00d0ad01fda9936476645", "ja": "それならいいんだ。……さて、これから朋花と美也の\n様子を見に行くつもりなんだけど、まつりもどうだ？", "zh": "那就好。……好了，我正打算去看看朋花和美也的情况，真礼也一起去怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "0d32081d7344406afdaf33daa9671261a61b850438cb65c2cf5cad6521ed5b5f", "ja": "もちろん行くのです！　頑張った二人には、\n姫からご褒美をあげないと♪", "zh": "当然要一起去！辛苦了的两个人，公主也得送上奖励才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e133aa4ef59621be28754db1db738fd107b755c1c9a5b422e6ad7cb2a052a11b", "ja": "ご褒美か。じゃあ俺からも、何かあげないとな。\n……何がいいと思う？", "zh": "奖励啊。那我也得送她们点什么才行。\n……你觉得送什么好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "2f6e23ccdc11f5f62bb37743c480cf3555a448a6c37db97ffc07834c935a99fe", "ja": "それなら……。きっと二人とも、また温泉でゆっくり\nしたいと思っているに違いないのです♪", "zh": "这样的话……两个人肯定都还想再去泡泡温泉，好好放松一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0753eb8bd57f521703c4f0e5c0ae0fdab733b47532d20ad12ff93f8870334db0", "ja": "へえ、温泉か……なるほど。\nよし、じゃあ帰りがけに、みんなで寄ろうか！", "zh": "哦，温泉啊……原来如此。好，那回去的时候，大家一起去一趟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "492bc7b6ecca1944f1d58f8edce06f40a8b0c6e868f1ffa50828e6930804a956", "ja": "わんだほー！なのです♪\nきっと二人とも大喜びなのです！", "zh": "太棒啦！♪\n两个人肯定都会特别开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "d79e93bd9c2408baf526f5d777fe45809361aff91af83843f740cb3007baa683", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんも、ちゃんと\n温泉で疲れを癒さないとダメなのですよ？", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生也得好好\n去温泉消除疲劳才行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1020_p", "source_sha256": "372872336c3d6131ea4310f59578943d2f90e2b4e29f794c7030e8277f2e6f2b", "ja": "もちろん、そうさせてもらうつもりだよ。\nただ……。", "zh": "当然，我正打算这么做呢。\n只是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1021_p", "source_sha256": "334eed17fd3125014073c83d91c33ecc19c61d348dcd79c4fad4590d40ce51e7", "ja": "朋花も、美也も、そしてまつりも。3人がゆっくり\nしてくれないと、俺はゆっくりできないんだよな。", "zh": "朋花也好，美也也好，还有祭也是。3个人要是不好好休息，我也没办法安心休息啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0194_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5a618966bf94b14b125f87279f036cb33b1df7b0fc85fbd73d6659e4a008f49", "ja": "大丈夫なのです。もちろん……\nまつりも、思いっきり、ゆっくりするのです♪", "zh": "没问题的哦。当然了……\n茉莉也会尽情、好好放松的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
